Sun Aug 02 18:50:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>

- Fix unresolvable Fedora package names in Requires: libXScrnSaver1,
  gtk3, libnotify, vulkan-loader do not exist on openSUSE. Replaced with
  soname-based Requires (libXss.so.1()(64bit), libgtk-3.so.0()(64bit),
  libnotify.so.4()(64bit), libvulkan.so.1()(64bit)) so `zypper install`
  resolves cleanly on Tumbleweed/Slowroll.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Aug 02 2026 - Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>

- Fix wrong version 19.2.5 -> 0.9.125: 19.2.5 was a Stripe billing SDK
  version picked up by a wildcard grep; the authoritative version comes
  from the .NET app's sq.version NuSpec metadata (0.9.125), matching the
  AUR rootapp-bin package. update.sh now reads sq.version exclusively.

